                            <h2 class="title" id="overview_heading">Overview</h2>
                            <h2>"Upstream": Positioning a Mission-Driven Healthcare Brand for Growth</h2>
<p>HealthBegins—an organization focused on improving health by promoting equity—was at an inflection point. The company had an opportunity to grow and become to be the go-to resource for organizations to looking to implement "upstream" healthcare practices. HealthBegins needed to establish an authentic, credible brand identity and voice that resonated with their audiences in the industry, but also set them apart as a truly innovative, unique, solution-focused organization. We stepped in to help them find a brand position they could occupy with confidence, and create the materials to own it.</p>
                        
                        

                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_understand_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="1">Understand</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <p>HealthBegins holds a unique viewpoint on healthcare. Working together, we quickly realized that positioning such an organization would involve more internal than external research. We ran workshops with the HealthBegins team to nail the vision, mission, and strategy of the organization using our Unsafe Thinking framework. This helped us reveal some key insights to explore with the brand.</p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Vision.d1adef4e.png" alt="HealthBegins Vision" width="685" loading="lazy" style="width: 685px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Vision.d02bc2b6.png 343w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Vision.d1adef4e.png 685w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Vision.d4582401.png 1028w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Vision.94456134.png 1370w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Vision.a27d8a15.png 1713w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Vision.51b58fb8.png 2055w" sizes="(max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px"></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                        


                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_explore_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading align-right" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="2">Explore</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <p>We learned that HealthBegins could be compared to a tugboat—a small, strong, and nimble craft that guides bigger ships through unknown, potentially dangerous waters.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Similarly, HealthBegins is a catalyst in the upstream healthcare space, using its unparalleled expertise to help larger organizations navigate what is, for many, an unfamiliar territory. We worked with the company to identify colors, imagery, and icons that would evoke a sense of power, passion, optimism, and empathy, laying the groundwork for a brand identity that would complement its mission:</p>
<p>"HealthBegins—helping guide some of the biggest ships in the healthcare business upstream."</p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors.b23a9842.jpeg" alt="HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors" width="744" loading="lazy" style="width: 744px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors.30f12531.jpeg 372w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors.b23a9842.jpeg 744w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors.55977505.jpeg 1116w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors.33f00ce1.jpeg 1488w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors.b2b8220d.jpeg 1860w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins_Explore_Topography-colors.53a76902.jpeg 2232w" sizes="(max-width: 744px) 100vw, 744px"></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                        


                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_create_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="3">Create</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <p><span>To help establish immediate trust with the large organizations that HealthBegins is best-suited to assist, we created a fresh logo with a blue, yellow, and white color scheme applied as part of a new, more modern design system. </span></p>
<p><span>We also updated the HealthBegins website for improved communication—streamlining its information architecture, curating its imagery, and incorporating subtle animations and </span>parallaxes that reveal the many layers of the organization's work. The new visual hierarchy aligns with their layers of services to represent a new way of thinking as a critical part of the revitalized HealthBegins brand.</p>
<p>In addition, we consolidated the company's resources in a single, centralized hub, allowing HealthBegins employees to showcase their work and share the tenets of their philosophy with key partners and clients.&nbsp;</p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Primary-Colors.b05e4e04.jpeg" alt="HealthBegins-Primary-Colors" width="1393" loading="lazy" style="width: 1393px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Primary-Colors.9b485346.jpeg 697w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Primary-Colors.b05e4e04.jpeg 1393w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Primary-Colors.0777579b.jpeg 2090w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Primary-Colors.21f27e5f.jpeg 2786w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Primary-Colors.7fde0b5f.jpeg 3483w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Primary-Colors.74ce6e33.jpeg 4179w" sizes="(max-width: 1393px) 100vw, 1393px"></p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Logos-combined.ac70ca2e.jpeg" alt="HealthBegins-Logos-combined" width="1574" loading="lazy" style="width: 1574px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Logos-combined.59eb0994.jpeg 787w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Logos-combined.ac70ca2e.jpeg 1574w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Logos-combined.f11b265e.jpeg 2361w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Logos-combined.65c0cff1.jpeg 3148w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Logos-combined.6210416e.jpeg 3935w, /hs-fs/hubfs/HealthBegins-Logos-combined.1e8a97cd.jpeg 4722w" sizes="(max-width: 1574px) 100vw, 1574px"></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                        


                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_launch_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading align-right" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="4">Launch</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <p><span>The new website and brand is widely appreciated by the current HealthBegins team and clients, and has helped the team with lead generation and client engagement. We continue to work closely with the organization to host and manage its website with iterations, new enhancements, and features based on real-world data and feedback.</span></p>
